{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>佳存媽媽鈣片60片裝（Caltrate MaMa Calcium Supplement）邊度買平？新假期整理屈臣氏、萬寧及HKTVmall共3間零售商的網店報價。以同款單盒標價計，最低與次低相差HK$88，約34%。</p>\n<h2>佳存媽媽鈣片60片裝各網店報價</h2>\n<table>\n<thead></thead>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th><strong>零售商</strong></th>\n<th><strong>單盒標價</strong></th>\n<th><strong>單盒總額</strong></th>\n<th><strong>計價條件</strong></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>最低已核實｜HKTVmall</strong></td>\n<td><strong>HK$174</strong></td>\n<td><strong>HK$174</strong></td>\n<td><strong>單盒標價</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>屈臣氏</td>\n<td>HK$262</td>\n<td>HK$262</td>\n<td>單盒標價</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>萬寧</td>\n<td>HK$262</td>\n<td>HK$262</td>\n<td>單盒標價</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h2>佳存媽媽鈣片60片裝單盒價錢點計？</h2>\n<p>買一盒，HKTVmall的同款網上標價為HK$174，較表列次低標價HK$262少HK$88。這個價差以單盒商品標價比較。若打算買多件，宜另計商戶的購買條件及結帳價。</p>\n<p>以上為2026年11月13日商戶網上報價，未計運費，價格、優惠及供應以商戶為準。網店來源：<a href=\"https://www.watsons.com.hk/zh-hk/%E4%BD%B3%E5%AD%98-%E5%AA%BD%E5%AA%BD%E9%88%A3%E7%89%87/p/BP_246228\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">屈臣氏</a><a href=\"https://www.mannings.com.hk/zh-hant/caltrate-mama-calcium-supplement-60pcs/p/453910\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">萬寧</a><a href=\"https://www.hktvmall.com/hktv/zh/main/%E8%87%BB%E7%BE%8E/s/B1306001/%E6%AF%8D%E5%AC%B0%E8%82%B2%E5%85%92/%E6%AF%8D%E5%AC%B0%E8%82%B2%E5%85%92/%E7%94%A2%E5%89%8D-%E7%94%A2%E5%BE%8C-%E5%B0%88%E5%8D%80/%E9%88%A3%E7%89%87-%E8%91%89%E9%85%B8-%E7%87%9F%E9%A4%8A%E8%A3%9C%E5%85%85%E5%93%81/%E5%AD%95%E5%A9%A6%E9%88%A3-%E7%B6%AD%E4%BB%96%E5%91%BD/%E4%BD%B3%E5%AD%98-Caltrate%E4%BD%B3%E5%AD%98%E5%AA%BD%E5%AA%BD%E9%88%A3%E7%89%87-60%E7%89%87/p/B1306001_S_246\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">HKTVmall</a></p>\n<p>品牌列出此款含鈣和維他命D。鈣是骨骼及牙齒的重要成分，維他命D有助人體吸收鈣質。如對成分或服用有疑問，建議先諮詢醫生或其他合資格的醫護專業人士。<a href=\"https://ods.od.nih.gov/factsheets/Calcium-Consumer/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">美國國立衞生研究院鈣質資料</a></p>\n<p>計算方法：（較高標價－較低標價）÷較高標價×100%。本次以（HK$262－HK$174）÷HK$262×100%計，約34%。上述比例未計運費及額外活動，亦不代表全港最低價、歷史低價或不同包裝版本的配方已完全核實一致。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179453427895333513_7124648166af66b87b4c58.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"佳存媽媽鈣片60片裝格價：HKTVmall HK$174，單盒約平34%\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179453427895333513_7124648166af66b87b4c58.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a></p>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>點樣先可以用圖中價格買到佳存媽媽鈣片60片裝？<i></i></p>\n<p>以2026年11月13日網上報價，HKTVmall的單盒商品總額為HK$174。條件為單盒標價，未計運費。</p>\n<p>今次格價比較哪一款包裝？<i></i></p>\n<p>本次比較媽媽鈣片60片裝。懷孕或授乳期間，如已服用其他鈣或維他命D補充品，可請醫生或藥劑師先核對成分及總攝取量。</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T01:53:46.636854+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":732,"images":1,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T01:44:41+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T04:49:32.359463+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T01:47:09.094711+00:00","content_hash":"a02e1b1cfb2dae945dca0ef13065416dbc114af52da98dbb6486f6d1c8890404","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}